/**
 * A published legacy DB row for an in-repo editorial slug must not leak
 * auto-generated attributes, scores, ratings, or a winner into the page.
 * The editorial pack is the whole comparison. The DB row's status stays a
 * linkability signal and is not what this test covers.
 */
